  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "It would be nice if we didn’t need to have to reload the worlds and avatars every time we restart the game. When we use the fastest internet available like smartphones, it easily takes 1go / h when we change often world.\nAn option that could be activated if players want to work with this method. On my side for an NVME in M.2 of 2TO of 1,8go / s or 3,6go / s, there will be no problem and an almost instantaneous loading.",
